od [format(stats.updated)] not found on class [org.ocpsoft.prettytime.PrettyTime] nor handled by an extension method\r\n\t- at StatusResource/issues.html:17\r\n\t\tat io.quarkus.qute.deployment.QuteProcessor.processTemplateErrors(QuteProcessor.java:173)\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n## To Reproduce\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Clone https://github.com/gastaldi/quarkus-status\r\n2. Change to branch `pretty_time`\r\n3. Run `mvn clean compile quarkus:dev`\r\n\r\n## Configuration\r\n```properties\r\n# Add your application.properties here, if applicable.\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n(If applicable, add screenshots to help explain your problem.)\r\n\r\n## Environment (please complete the following information):\r\n - Output of `uname -a` or `ver`: Fedora 33\r\n - Output of `java -version`: JDK 11\r\n - GraalVM version (if different from Java): Not needed to reproduce\r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: 1.12.2.Final\r\n - Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`): Maven 3.6.3\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"famod","id":22860528,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODYwNTI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22860528?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/famod","html_url":"https://github.com/famod","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/famod/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/famod/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/famod/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/famod/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/famod/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/famod/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/famod/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/famod/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/famod/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus